The placebo arm also hardened 0/3, so the diagnostic is bare 0/3, hinted 0/3, placebo 0/3 and hinted-minus-placebo \(0.0\). The hint neither broke the family nor measurably changed success. I’m now freezing those results into the module, regenerating the final self-test report, and writing the README from the actual transcripts.
